<report>
<line><title>Incidence rate difference (IRD) meta-analysis</title></line>
<line></line>
<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><thfirst>Table (a, person-time exposed, b, person-time not exposed)</thfirst><thspan/><thspan/><thspan/><th></th></tr>
<block name="inputs">
<tr><td><in>st</in></td><td><in>a</in></td><td><in>pt1</in></td><td><in>b</in></td><td><in>pt2</in></td><td><in>lb</in></td></tr>
</block>
</table>
<line></line>
<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>IRD</th><thfirst><ci><in>pc</in>% CI (approximate)</ci></thfirst><thspan/><th></th></tr>
<block name="ir"><tr><td><in>st</in></td><td><in>ird</in></td><td><ci><in>lci</in></ci></td><td><ci><in>uci</in></ci></td><td><warnabit><in>lb</in></warnabit></td></tr></block>
</table>
<line></line>
<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>Standardized effect</th><th>Variance</th><thfirst>% Weights (fixed, random)</thfirst><thspan/><th></th></tr>
<block name="ir"><tr><td><in>st</in></td><td><in>yi</in></td><td><in>vi</in></td><td><in>wt</in></td><td><in>dwt</in></td><td><warnabit><in>lb</in></warnabit></td></tr></block>
</table>
<line></line>
<line><subtitle>Fixed effects (inverse variance)</subtitle></line>
<line>Pooled IRD = <in>rmh</in> (<ci><in>pc</in>% CI = <in>from</in> to <in>to</in></ci>)</line>
<line>Z (test IRD differs from 0) = <in>z</in>  <pval><in>p_z</in></pval></line>
<line></line>
<line><subtitle>Non-combinability of studies</subtitle></line>
<line>Cohran Q = <in>qc</in>  (df = <in>df</in>)  <pval><in>xp</in></pval></line>
<line>Moment-based estimate of between studies variance = <in>tausq</in></line>
<line>I<sub>2</sub> (inconsistency) = <in>isq</in>% (<ci><in>pc1</in>% CI = <in>llisq</in>% to <in>ulisq</in>%</ci>) </line>
<line></line>
<line><subtitle>Random effects (DerSimonian-Laird)</subtitle></line>
<line>Pooled IRD = <in>dsird</in> (<ci><in>pc</in>% CI = <in>dsll</in>  to  <in>dsul</in></ci>)</line>
<line>Z (test IRD differs from 0) = <in>dz</in>  <pval><in>dp</in></pval></line>
<line></line>
<block name="egger">
<line><subtitle>Bias indicators</subtitle></line>
<line>Begg-Mazumdar: Kendall's <in>tau</in>  <pval><in>p2</in></pval></line>
<line>Egger: bias = <in>a</in> (<ci><in>pc_egger</in>% CI = <in>cl</in> to <in>cu</in></ci>)  <pval><in>p</in></pval></line>
</block>
</report>
